NB. 13
i13 =:'Alice would gain 54 happiness units by sitting next to Bob.ZAlice would lose 81 happiness units by sitting next to Carol.ZAlice would lose 42 happiness units by sitting next to David.ZAlice would gain 89 happiness units by sitting next to Eric.ZAlice would lose 89 happiness units by sitting next to Frank.ZAlice would gain 97 happiness units by sitting next to George.ZAlice would lose 94 happiness units by sitting next to Mallory.ZBob would gain 3 happiness units by sitting next to Alice.ZBob would lose 70 happiness units by sitting next to Carol.ZBob would lose 31 happiness units by sitting next to David.ZBob would gain 72 happiness units by sitting next to Eric.ZBob would lose 25 happiness units by sitting next to Frank.ZBob would lose 95 happiness units by sitting next to George.ZBob would gain 11 happiness units by sitting next to Mallory.ZCarol would lose 83 happiness units by sitting next to Alice.ZCarol would gain 8 happiness units by sitting next to Bob.ZCarol would gain 35 happiness units by sitting next to David.ZCarol would gain 10 happiness units by sitting next to Eric.ZCarol would gain 61 happiness units by sitting next to Frank.ZCarol would gain 10 happiness units by sitting next to George.ZCarol would gain 29 happiness units by sitting next to Mallory.ZDavid would gain 67 happiness units by sitting next to Alice.ZDavid would gain 25 happiness units by sitting next to Bob.ZDavid would gain 48 happiness units by sitting next to Carol.ZDavid would lose 65 happiness units by sitting next to Eric.ZDavid would gain 8 happiness units by sitting next to Frank.ZDavid would gain 84 happiness units by sitting next to George.ZDavid would gain 9 happiness units by sitting next to Mallory.ZEric would lose 51 happiness units by sitting next to Alice.ZEric would lose 39 happiness units by sitting next to Bob.ZEric would gain 84 happiness units by sitting next to Carol.ZEric would lose 98 happiness units by sitting next to David.ZEric would lose 20 happiness units by sitting next to Frank.ZEric would lose 6 happiness units by sitting next to George.ZEric would gain 60 happiness units by sitting next to Mallory.ZFrank would gain 51 happiness units by sitting next to Alice.ZFrank would gain 79 happiness units by sitting next to Bob.ZFrank would gain 88 happiness units by sitting next to Carol.ZFrank would gain 33 happiness units by sitting next to David.ZFrank would gain 43 happiness units by sitting next to Eric.ZFrank would gain 77 happiness units by sitting next to George.ZFrank would lose 3 happiness units by sitting next to Mallory.ZGeorge would lose 14 happiness units by sitting next to Alice.ZGeorge would lose 12 happiness units by sitting next to Bob.ZGeorge would lose 52 happiness units by sitting next to Carol.ZGeorge would gain 14 happiness units by sitting next to David.ZGeorge would lose 62 happiness units by sitting next to Eric.ZGeorge would lose 18 happiness units by sitting next to Frank.ZGeorge would lose 17 happiness units by sitting next to Mallory.ZMallory would lose 36 happiness units by sitting next to Alice.ZMallory would gain 76 happiness units by sitting next to Bob.ZMallory would lose 34 happiness units by sitting next to Carol.ZMallory would gain 37 happiness units by sitting next to David.ZMallory would gain 40 happiness units by sitting next to Eric.ZMallory would gain 18 happiness units by sitting next to Frank.ZMallory would gain 7 happiness units by sitting next to George.Z'
N =:~.,({. , {:)@;:;._2 (#~[:-.'.'e.~ ]) i13
H =:((N i.{.),(N i.{:),(0".[:>3{])*_1 1{~(<'gain')=2{])@;:;._2 (#~[:-.'.'e.~ ]) i13
